frames = empty list
last_used = map
time = 0
page_faults = 0

For each page in reference_string:

  time = time + 1

  If page is already in frames:
    last_used[page] = time

  Else:
    page_faults = page_faults + 1

    If frames not full:
      add page to frames

    Else:
      victim = page in frames with smallest last_used value
      remove victim from frames
      add new page to frames

    last_used[page] = time
